from being confused.



A can't agree that Tiki doesn't bring such confusion. Just open ... let's
say...
http://www.lojban.org/tiki/ba'oi

Do you like it?
Now imagine a newbie that came from direct search in google to that page.
His immediate reaction? "WTH". ba'a this person closes this page in their
browser and never returns back to this website. Sure, even my templates
won't help much which means that the design still needs to be improved a
lot.

Now I estimate the number unique visitors a month to lojban.org/tiki at
~3000. Where are those people? Why don't they come here or to IRC channel?
ju'o sa'u The presentation of information is broken.

